<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Code-to-model traceability: 56/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Basic docstrings are present, but functions lack explicit equation and table mappings to Newman & Frisch (1979) Eqs. (1)-(7) & Table 1, Saunders (1948) AER excision experiments, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_012_limb_chondrogenesis_turing.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py L25–L36: Docstrings omit explicit equation numbers and Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py#L25-L36>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Model fidelity to source: 48/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the analytical wavenumber formula `compute_newman_mode_number` (L25-28), but `synthesize_standing_wave_box` (L31-36) plots a static `-cos(2*m*pi*X)*sin(pi*Z)` formula instead of numerically integrating the nonlinear 2-component Turing reaction-diffusion PDE with Neumann/Dirichlet boundary conditions inside the shrinking apical progress zone L_PD(t) or assembling the composite 2D proximodistal limb bud (`1 -> 2 -> 3` skeletal compartments)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py L31–L36: Static cosine-sine heuristic instead of nonlinear Turing reaction-diffusion PDE solver <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py#L31-L36>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 4.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Morphometric validation: 40/100" ;
