    pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py L67–L90: Only 2 analytical measurements returned; no PDE peak counting or specimen morphometrics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py#L67-L90>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh20-stylopod-mode-number-m-l-pd-500-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-measurement-hh27-chick-wing-autopod-mode-number-m-l-pd-140-um> ;
    pk:hasScore 4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — MorphoEval overall 45.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py` (overall weighted score: 47.4 / 100). The v1 baseline script computes the analytical critical mode number m = sqrt((Dv*fu + Du*gv)/(2*Du*Dv)) for stylopod (m=1) and autopod (m=3), but synthesizes spatial condensations via a closed-form trigonometric formula (`synthesize_standing_wave_box`) rather than numerically integrating the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component fibronectin/TGF-beta Turing reaction-diffusion PDE coupled to the shrinking apical progress zone L_PD(t) and frozen proximal chondrogenic compartments; omits the 4-digit chick hindlimb stage (HH28, m=4), AER surgical excision truncation controls (HH20 and HH24 excisions), and equal-diffusion / hyaluronate-excess negative controls; does not load or segment the vendored Gallus gallus wing skeleton specimen; and returns only 2 analytical scalar measurements without PDE peak counts or specimen morphometrics. Overall 45.6/100 (faithfulness 38.6, reproducibility 62.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 48, Morphological realism / specimen match 28, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 40, Source and data traceability 60, Code-to-model traceability 56, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 1979-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 198805 B, 1307×429 px, artifact_sha256 9508d38c1641902f41ae3bb78b22063c03fbbe63c3c0a00bd358a6598898315f (sha256 9508d38c1641902f41ae3bb78b22063c03fbbe63c3c0a00bd358a6598898315f), spec_fingerprint 381dc7883b80c95da9d476a5865f816bf3bb5de908cfdb8ef8c6bbef3a244a82. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 381dc7883b80c95da9d476a5865f816bf3bb5de908cfdb8ef8c6bbef3a244a82; artifact_sha256: 9508d38c1641902f41ae3bb78b22063c03fbbe63c3c0a00bd358a6598898315f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/chick_wing_skeleton_specimen.jpg=771e26f9fe8c813d..., datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_reference.json=c30d742bbf2a990a..., datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/scout_manifest.json=7f3605aa11f5e077...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameters (--stage, --L-PD-um, --Du, --Dv, --fv, --gv, --steps, --seed), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-backed morphometric measurements, and upgrade `docs/media/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_comparison.png` (8-panel synthesis figure) and `docs/media/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_growth.gif` (sequential proximodistal outgrowth + AER excision animation).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/limb_chondrogenesis_turing/limb_chondrogenesis_turing_reference.json`, `chick_wing_skeleton_specimen.jpg`, `scout_manifest.json`, and `paper_citations.bib` at runtime; segment the humerus (1 bone), radius+ulna (2 bones), and carpometacarpus/digits II-IV (3 elements) directly from the Gallus gallus wing specimen; and compare specimen bone counts and transverse spacing ratios against the nonlinear Turing PDE.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the static cosine-sine heuristic with a genuine nonlinear 2-component cubic-saturated Turing reaction-diffusion PDE solver (du/dt = f_u(L_PD, D_eff)*u + f_v*v - u^3 + D_u*Lap(u), dv/dt = g_u(L_PD, D_eff)*u + g_v*v + D_v*Lap(v)) with zero-flux Neumann anteroposterior boundaries (x in {0, L_AP}) and pinned/apical proximodistal boundaries (z in [0, L_PD(t)]), plus a 2D composite proximodistal limb bud solver that freezes stylopod (m=1) -> zeugopod (m=2) -> autopod (m=3) compartments sequentially.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate all 4 developmental regimes from Newman & Frisch (1979) Table 1 (HH20 stylopod L_PD=500 um -> 1 humerus; HH24 zeugopod L_PD=250 um -> 2 radius+ulna; HH27 wing autopod L_PD=140 um -> 3 digits II-IV; HH28 hindlimb autopod L_PD=115 um -> 4 pedal digits I-IV), the 3-step AER surgical excision truncation series ([1,0,0] -> [1,2,0] -> [1,2,3] elements), and dual negative controls (equal diffusion Du=Dv=0.5 and hyaluronate-excess sub-Turing fu=1.5)." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.56e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-newman-limb-chondrogenesis-turing-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Newman & Frisch (1979) Science 3D Helmholtz/Turing standing-wave eigenmodes and proximodistal 1 -> 2 -> 3 skeletal chondrogenesis in developing Gallus gallus wing bud — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
